#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/gateway.js:246
msgid "A local host name that follows a device between its own ZeroTier client and its mapped LAN address: the router checks every minute which of the two answers and points the name there (dnsmasq)."
msgstr "让一个本地主机名跟随设备在\"自身 ZeroTier 客户端地址\"和\"局域网映射地址\"之间切换：路由器每分钟检查哪一个能连通，就把名字指向哪一个（dnsmasq）。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/permissions.js:261
msgid "A member is recognized by the MAC address ZeroTier derives from its node address, never by IP, so it cannot borrow another member's grants by taking its address."
msgstr "成员按 ZeroTier 由节点地址推导出的 MAC 地址识别，从不按 IP 识别，因此无法通过冒用他人的 IP 借用别人的授权。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/moon.js:169
msgid "A moon ID has 10 hexadecimal digits"
msgstr "Moon ID 是 10 位十六进制数"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/zerotier/moon.js:79
msgid "A moon is a root server of your own: nodes that orbit it find each other through it, faster and without depending on the public roots. Its endpoints have to be reachable from where those nodes are."
msgstr "Moon 是自建的根服务器：加入它的节点通过它互相发现，更快，也不依赖公共根服务器。它发布的地址必须能被这些节点访问到。"

